extends base

block content
  h1 Welcome to Plete
  p Hi #{firstName},
  p We're glad to have you with us. Plete is designed to give you clear visibility and control over your personal finances with minimal effort.

  table.btn(role='presentation', border='0', cellpadding='0', cellspacing='0')
    tbody
      tr
        td(align='left')
          table(role='presentation', border='0', cellpadding='0', cellspacing='0')
            tbody
              tr
                td
                  a(href=`${url}`, target='_blank') Start Managing Finances

  p If you have any questions or need a hand getting started, simply reply to this email and our support team will be happy to help.
  p.signoff — Team Plete

